      "id": "u07-3",
      "title": "What time is it?",
      "explanation": [
        "**Hoe laat is dit?** = What time is it? (literally *how late is it?*)",
        "**Dit is drie-uur.** = It's three o'clock. (**uur** = hour, o'clock)",
        "Careful: **half vier** means *half past three*, because it's half-way to four!",
        "**nou** = now."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Hoe laat is dit?",
          "en": "What time is it?"
        },
        {
          "af": "Dit is drie-uur.",
          "en": "It's three o'clock."
        },
        {
          "af": "Dit is half vier.",
          "en": "It's half past three."
        },
        {
          "af": "Dit is nou tien-uur.",
          "en": "It's ten o'clock now."
        }
      ],
